{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img alt=\"闇影詩章WB新卡包「尼坎赫亞弒神事件」將於10月28日追加！先行公開8張新卡\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5b0c7820bf35af8734f7fff03f68f6ee47e2dc9b3e061c90bac304afe6281600/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc7fb53485c838601e940e5bbd58ed900.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>闇影詩章WB新卡包「尼坎赫亞弒神事件」將於10月28日追加！先行公開8張新卡</figcaption></figure><p>「<strong>Shadowverse: Worlds Beyond</strong>」將於 2026年10月28日(三)追加 第10彈卡包「<strong>Deicide in Nacreheim / 尼坎赫亞弒神事件</strong>」。<br/>公開了8張新卡、解謎網站，以及紀念新彈追加的活動等資訊。</p><h2>闇影詩章WB將於10月28日追加「尼坎赫亞弒神事件」！先行公開8張新卡</h2><blockquote><p></p></blockquote><p>在2026年10月24日(六)播出的「<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YpfsK5U47ds\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">闇影詩章頻道Beyond 第10彈卡包資訊公開！</a>」中，公開了第10彈卡包「Deicide in Nacreheim / 尼坎赫亞弒神事件」的資訊。<br/>本卡包將於 2026年10月28日(三) 追加。</p><p></p><blockquote><p></p></blockquote><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/shadowverse-wb-deicide-in-nacreheim-announcement/335264/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"探偵と大罪人について\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/bfb1b74f2668efb02a8d0fdca8d468244d70a2d38f4d1f7fda660f779ca7023a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0fdffb69b27ef151a60edae1f9d58dd2.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>探偵と大罪人について</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/shadowverse-wb-deicide-in-nacreheim-announcement/335265/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"神殺事件について\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4c9d7279c0be32744f3d27c80aa97fe70f11e6a323f6956174abddac3ac15e6b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F950979b814069ccc8137acf4e7ce0d81.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>神殺事件について</figcaption></a><p>節目中介紹了PV、本卡包登場的偵探與大罪人角色，以及作為故事核心的神殺事件。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><h3>先行公開8張新卡</h3><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/shadowverse-wb-deicide-in-nacreheim-announcement/335266/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"地害の三悪・ラピッドハット\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1bb92521f49c7bb207069b20704ccb7ef3bd827520e485fc5f8db9de2c8e355b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5f52cbc88d03529e6d9bc946a496bc74.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>地害の三悪・ラピッドハット</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/shadowverse-wb-deicide-in-nacreheim-announcement/335267/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"地害の兎\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2f2c993d5c9ef88eca32d2d88d2fc97639d197fb838c8d6c83b85cc21f5ee662/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc895576289988b34c984e78d4b5f0381.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>地害の兎</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/shadowverse-wb-deicide-in-nacreheim-announcement/335268/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"地害の加工人\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7ce777afd5352bca719fb0b9071dfc60949c57f09c1801f366cfc1a85023761e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fde7cfc7f255609242d85e31e7dafc2d8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>地害の加工人</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/shadowverse-wb-deicide-in-nacreheim-announcement/335269/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"神域の物証\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2aedf56d5fb54869ba7945f316e5973965329ed886175404c43dafc9b0e9db83/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9666d8465fb3a8421852de153e2a1923.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>神域の物証</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/shadowverse-wb-deicide-in-nacreheim-announcement/335270/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"理想郷・ニーゲルヘリア\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1c4fff5376a023de381cafc296c6ffb7e88c20f7796bd72d6a4a710c07abedf4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F11b164f797063bcd6c270bcb2b9ad975.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>理想郷・ニーゲルヘリア</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/shadowverse-wb-deicide-in-nacreheim-announcement/335271/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"チーキーデザイナー\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/515a6c1464119056f2fe231c2560bd94619db275abbf3215e4c2e0ffe8ae4f30/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6770d30f0ed80adc9e486f40eb558b80.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>チーキーデザイナー</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/shadowverse-wb-deicide-in-nacreheim-announcement/335272/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"無垢なる新聞売り\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0de365ad4ad1f13688727c3bcbcd6cf4d043b2ccfa0ea3858cbf84028af30226/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1df6733bb96dff999440b1d523b31d01.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>無垢なる新聞売り</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/shadowverse-wb-deicide-in-nacreheim-announcement/335273/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"表裏探偵・ノー・ライフ\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/57a508bbc691348d3a8748975f73def995e2930905717627db210d855f5cf74f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F12ef0bba28cca3a8ad9ea22e59febc30.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>表裏探偵・ノー・ライフ</figcaption></a><p>從預定收錄於「尼坎赫亞弒神事件」的卡片與衍生物卡中，先行公開了包含傳說卡在內的8張卡片。</p><ul><li><p>地害的三惡・快速帽: 主教職業 / 傳說</p></li><li><p>地害之兔: 主教職業 / 青銅稀有</p></li><li><p>地害的加工人: 主教職業 / 青銅稀有</p></li><li><p>神域的物證: 中立職業 / 青銅稀有</p></li><li><p>理想鄉・尼格爾海利亞: 中立職業 / 黃金稀有</p></li><li><p>狡黠設計師: 皇家職業 / 白銀稀有</p></li><li><p>純真報童: 皇家職業 / 青銅稀有</p></li><li><p>表裏偵探・諾萊芬: 皇家職業 / 傳說</p></li></ul><h3>公開解謎網站「神殺事件調查錄」</h3><figure><p><img alt=\"神殺事件調查錄\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d2e6ca1df0fe9cbddb987817570d611cc8119811c7439a6b3b5049c33a12084d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8ca3c9e46f606398faa2da354841fd39.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>追查神殺事件全貌的解謎網站「神殺事件調查錄」已公開。<br/>從登場人物的對話中收集資訊與證據，一邊解開提示的謎題一邊推進調查。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"限定URL\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ad1a4abbaa7ccc21a11ebe0caadcd7bb3659a4a530018c5a3ce1fbfbbb568278/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff72266519e752a06a4329c04191a2feb.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>解開所有謎題後，可從Cygames WebStore的限定URL先行購買卡片樣式、徽章、卡套、水晶的套組。<br/>卡片樣式套組預定於新卡包追加約1個月後進行一般販售。</p><p>可從<a href=\"https://deicide-in-nacreheim.shadowverse-wb.com/ja/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">「神殺事件調查錄」特設網站</a>挑戰解謎。</p><h3>交換券中快速帽登場</h3><figure><p><img alt=\"交換券\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2321c873d6a44d104714bced578c88a3b79fa5f2f4e819ff5a4a5f4a9d7f4bd5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F140e0d7e4d8e0de0e735fe147599a6b4.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>「尼坎赫亞弒神事件」的交換券中，預定會有2名角色登場。<br/>節目中公開了快速帽，另一人將於日後在官方X(<a href=\"https://x.com/shadowverse_jp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@shadowverse_jp</a>)發表。</p><h3>舉辦可獲得最多10張卡包券的任務</h3><figure><p><img alt=\"任務\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6e09bf50d607e9e70c2158b89b44060b4a85effc280d7b04310bff8e375e93e3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F73834fbd5cac8143063264bef9df3dee.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>新卡包追加後，從首次登入日起3天內，每天都會追加任務。<br/>達成任務即可獲得最多10張「尼坎赫亞弒神事件」的卡包券。</p><h3>贈送含有2張傳說卡的牌組</h3><figure><p><img alt=\"牌組贈送活動\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0d0d8d9f768b484832f5cd7cc1d6556798adfea5e96c3ce1d61481fb139191dc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff5192654ae15863ff91cbe7310cc52eb.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>新卡包追加時起舉辦「牌組贈送活動」。<br/>可從含有新彈傳說卡、內含2張傳說卡的2個職業牌組中，選擇1個喜歡的牌組獲得。</p><h3>Cygames WebStore免費發放1000金幣</h3><figure><p><img alt=\"贈送1000金幣\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b3a90cb07387d30baf0eb3ae194f919df85dc0e45bf69fccb12762d0ee62d86d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa03c1211952d7e92fe4dce6567104875.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>為紀念「尼坎赫亞弒神事件」追加，將於<a href=\"https://webstore.cygames.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cygames WebStore</a>免費發放1000金幣。<br/>據悉今後每次追加卡包時，都能免費獲得1000金幣。</p><h3>販售卡片樣式套組等新商品</h3><figure><p><img alt=\"卡片樣式套組登場\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/99438193f0af97dd8ccfc6cd1582ce6ced176ba902ff42899fb257da77126eb2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe5f146785986e6dab0ce6da13ba0ce78.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>2026年10月28日(三)維護結束後起，將於補給商店販售3種卡片樣式套組。<br/>各商品附屬卡片樣式、卡套、徽章。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"卡包套組\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/01d4486aa8a936bccf1db03ade9ad2d5276edc8ee461d2253211cc53ad2fa805/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F89197705e6a2152e8a650d688254b98c.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>同日起來2026年11月4日(三)23:59(UTC+9)為止，也將推出附購買特典的卡包套組。<br/>購買至第10套可獲得徽章、卡套、高級寶珠、卡包券等，第10套附屬無命的卡片樣式。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"強化組合包套組\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/af295f4fb3fac9c0b1b3b21034d1e9c897715ab62bd816e942f6c5e50720a285/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0fd09d23e3e5526983436996b96c9310.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p><a href=\"https://webstore.cygames.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cygames WebStore</a>將販售收錄有償水晶2,000個、無償水晶200個、傳說卡包券3張、紅色乙太3,500個的限定牌組強化組合包套組。<br/>販售期間為2026年10月28日(三)維護結束後起，至第11彈卡包追加時的維護為止。</p><p>新卡包最新資訊請確認「Shadowverse: Worlds Beyond」官方X(<a href=\"https://x.com/shadowverse_jp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@shadowverse_jp</a>)。</p><blockquote><p></p><p>✦┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈<br/>第10弾カードパック<br/>「ニーゲルヘリア神殺事件 / Deicide in Nacreheim」<br/>┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈✦</p><p>10/28リリースの新カードパック「<a href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/%E3%83%8B%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B2%E3%83%AB%E3%83%98%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E7%A5%9E%E6%AE%BA%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#ニーゲルヘリア神殺事件</a>」のPVを公開！<a href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A3%E3%83%89%E3%83%90WB?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#シャドバWB</a><a href=\"https://t.co/kl8RT6yaJC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pic.twitter.com/kl8RT6yaJC</a></p><p>— Shadowverse: Worlds Beyond（シャドバWB）公式 (@shadowverse_jp) <a href=\"https://x.com/shadowverse_jp/status/2113939331627065518?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">October 24, 2026</a></p></blockquote><hr/><h4>延伸閱讀</h4><p><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/umamusume-ts7th-los-angeles-canceled-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸《賽馬娘》7th EVENT 洛杉磯公演因未取得美國簽證而取消，預計為參加者辦理退款等事宜</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/umamusume-ts7th-losangeles-held-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸《賽馬娘》世界巡迴演出洛杉磯場次 簽證至今仍未獲核准，將於 10 月 20 日前公布是否如期舉行</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/where-the-seeds-fall-demo-available/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸《崩落之國》Steam 體驗版 10 月 16 日開放下載！挑戰高難度「向下探索」動作玩法</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/cygames-shomarin-ice-dance-team-support-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸株式會社Cygames成為本田真凜・宇野昌磨冰舞隊伍的贊助商！支持挑戰2030年奧運</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/ps-shadowverse-wb-fennel-entry/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸FENNEL決定出戰「Shadowverse Premier Series」2027賽季！新設立Shadowverse部門</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:00:47.248226+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1997,"images":20,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T07:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T17:19:26.699499+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:58:29.931379+00:00","content_hash":"b1624a7a15777dee986f5e23423e1d8d93fc4621bb3541237cccabf6f016ccb1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}